{"html":"<p>HTML describes what&#39;s on a page: this is a heading, this is a list, this is a button. CSS makes it look good and JavaScript makes it interactive, but HTML comes first. Write it well and your page works on phones, with screen readers and for search engines, before any styling.</p>\n<h2 id=\"a-page-s-skeleton\">A Page&#39;s Skeleton</h2>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;!</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">doctype</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> html</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">html</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> lang</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"en\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">head</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> charset</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"utf-8\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"viewport\"</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> content</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">title</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>My Bakery&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">title</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">head</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">body</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>My Bakery&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">p</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Fresh bread every morning.&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">p</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">body</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">html</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><ul>\n<li><code>&lt;!doctype html&gt;</code> tells the browser it&#39;s modern HTML.</li>\n<li><code>lang=&quot;en&quot;</code> tells screen readers and translators the language.</li>\n<li>The <strong>head</strong> holds information about the page: the title in the browser tab, the character set, and the viewport line that makes it work on phones.</li>\n<li>The <strong>body</strong> holds what people see.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"elements-and-attributes\">Elements and Attributes</h2>\n<p>An element is a tag, its content and a closing tag: <code>&lt;p&gt;Fresh bread&lt;/p&gt;</code>. <strong>Attributes</strong> add details inside the opening tag:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">a</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> href</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"/menu/\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>See the menu&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">a</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">img</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> src</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"bread.jpg\"</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> alt</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"A loaf of sourdough on a wooden board\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> /></span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>A few elements, like <code>img</code>, <code>input</code> and <code>br</code>, have no content and no closing tag.</p>\n<h2 id=\"text-headings-paragraphs-and-emphasis\">Text: Headings, Paragraphs and Emphasis</h2>\n<p>Use <strong>one <code>h1</code></strong> for the page&#39;s title, then <code>h2</code> for sections and <code>h3</code> inside them, without skipping levels. Screen reader users jump between headings to find their way, like a table of contents.</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>My Bakery&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Our Bread&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">p</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Baked with &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">strong</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>organic flour&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">strong</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>, &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">em</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>every&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">em</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">> morning.&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">p</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p><code>strong</code> marks importance and <code>em</code> stress. Choose elements for their <strong>meaning</strong>, not their look: CSS handles size and weight.</p>\n<h2 id=\"links-and-images\">Links and Images</h2>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">a</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> href</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"/contact/\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Contact us&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">a</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">a</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> href</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"https://example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"_blank\"</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> rel</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"noopener\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Our supplier&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">a</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>Link text should make sense on its own: &quot;Contact us&quot;, not &quot;click here&quot;.</p>\n<p>Every image needs an <code>alt</code> text describing it for people who can&#39;t see it. A purely decorative image gets an empty <code>alt=&quot;&quot;</code>, so screen readers skip it.</p>\n<h2 id=\"lists\">Lists</h2>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">ul</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">li</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Sourdough&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">li</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">li</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Baguette&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">li</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">ul</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">ol</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">li</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Mix the flour and water.&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">li</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">li</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Let it rest overnight.&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">li</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">ol</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p><code>ul</code> is an unordered list, <code>ol</code> an ordered one. Navigation menus are usually lists of links, too.</p>\n<h2 id=\"semantic-structure\">Semantic Structure</h2>\n<p>Instead of <code>div</code> for everything, use elements that say what each part is:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">body</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">header</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Main\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">a</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> href</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"/\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Home&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">a</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">a</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> href</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"/menu/\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Menu&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">a</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">header</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">main</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">article</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Our New Rye Bread&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">p</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>…&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">p</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">article</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">main</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">footer</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>© My Bakery&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">footer</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">body</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><div data-table-scroll><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Element</th>\n<th>For</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>header</code></td>\n<td>The top of the page or of a section</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>nav</code></td>\n<td>A group of navigation links</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>main</code></td>\n<td>The page&#39;s main content, once per page</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>article</code></td>\n<td>A self-contained piece, like a post</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>section</code></td>\n<td>A themed part of a page, with a heading</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>aside</code></td>\n<td>Related content, like a sidebar</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>footer</code></td>\n<td>The bottom of the page or of a section</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p>Screen readers list these as landmarks, so users can jump straight to the main content. <code>div</code> and <code>span</code> remain for grouping with no meaning, often just for styling.</p>\n<h2 id=\"forms\">Forms</h2>\n<p>Forms collect input. The most important rule: <strong>every input needs a label</strong>.</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">form</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> action</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"/signup\"</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> method</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"post\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">label</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Email&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">label</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">input</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> required</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">label</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"plan\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Plan&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">label</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">select</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"plan\"</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"plan\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">option</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"free\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Free&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">option</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">option</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"pro\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Pro&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">option</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">select</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">label</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">input</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"checkbox\"</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"news\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    Send me the newsletter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">label</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">button</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"submit\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Sign up&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">button</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">form</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><ul>\n<li><code>for</code> on the label matches the input&#39;s <code>id</code>. Clicking the label focuses the input, and screen readers read the label.</li>\n<li><code>type=&quot;email&quot;</code>, <code>number</code>, <code>date</code> and <code>tel</code> bring the right keyboard on phones and basic validation.</li>\n<li><code>required</code>, <code>min</code>, <code>max</code> and <code>pattern</code> add built-in checks before the form is sent.</li>\n<li><code>name</code> is the key the server receives.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A placeholder isn&#39;t a label: it disappears as soon as you type.</p>\n<h2 id=\"buttons-vs-links\">Buttons vs Links</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A <strong>link</strong> (<code>&lt;a href&gt;</code>) goes somewhere: another page or another part of this one.</li>\n<li>A <strong>button</strong> (<code>&lt;button&gt;</code>) does something: submit, open, delete.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Don&#39;t make a clickable <code>div</code>: it can&#39;t be reached with the keyboard or understood by screen readers. A real <code>button</code> gets all of that for free.</p>\n<h2 id=\"accessibility-habits\">Accessibility Habits</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Use the element that means what you need: <code>button</code>, <code>nav</code>, <code>h2</code>, <code>label</code>.</li>\n<li>Write <code>alt</code> text for images, and label every input.</li>\n<li>Keep one <code>h1</code> and an ordered heading structure.</li>\n<li>Make sure everything works with the keyboard alone: Tab through your page.</li>\n<li>Don&#39;t rely on color alone, like red text, to show an error: add words.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>These habits help everyone: keyboard users, screen reader users, people on small screens, and search engines.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-answer-in-short\">The Answer in Short</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>A page has a head (title, charset, viewport) and a body; set <code>lang</code> on <code>html</code>.</li>\n<li>Use one <code>h1</code>, ordered headings, and elements chosen for their meaning.</li>\n<li>Links need clear text, images need <code>alt</code>, and inputs need a <code>label</code>.</li>\n<li>Structure pages with <code>header</code>, <code>nav</code>, <code>main</code>, <code>article</code> and <code>footer</code>.</li>\n<li>Links go somewhere, buttons do something; never fake them with a <code>div</code>.</li>\n</ol>\n"}